# Keep the Docker build context minimal and secret-free (issue #161 AC-5/AC-6).
# Nothing here is a secret, but excluding .env/web/dist/coverage keeps the
# context small and guarantees no .env or built artifacts ever reach a layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
dist/
web/public/
web/data/
coverage.out
*.test
.github/
docs/
archive/
